{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやき坂46の井口眞緒です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH39CYZZK774SEPT9TYXK21","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう春ですねーーーᕦ(ò_óˇ)ᕤ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちいい〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな季節は夏だったのですが、春に変更になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな季節は春です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でももしかして、夏になったら夏が好きになるのかもしれません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも秋は寂しくて、冬は寒いので苦手です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春になるとポカポカして楽しくて夏は暑くてワクワクします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかるかなー？？この気持ち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもちゃーんと日焼け止め塗らなきゃですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は日焼け止めを塗ることを頑張る春夏にしたいと思いますᕦ(ò_óˇ)ᕤ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いぐちまお"}],"source":"archive"}